<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Purchase Order — {{poNumber}} | {{orgName}}</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --ink:        #1c2b3a;
      --ink-mid:    #4a5d6e;
      --ink-light:  #7a8fa0;
      --rule:       #dde3ea;
      --rule-dark:  #b0bec8;
      --page:       #f2f5f8;
      --white:      #ffffff;
      --accent:     #0f3460;
      --stripe:     #f7f9fb;
      --red:        #b91c1c;
      --red-bg:     #fef2f2;
      --green:      #166534;
      --green-bg:   #f0fdf4;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--page);
      padding: 28px 16px 56px;
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

    .toolbar { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .toolbar-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-light); letter-spacing: .3px; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 8px 18px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; letter-spacing: .3px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    .btn:hover { background: #163e72; }

    .doc { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--rule-dark); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }

    .watermark {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-35deg);
      font-size: 96px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 12px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .watermark-unpaid { color: rgba(185,28,28,.05); }
    .watermark-paid   { color: rgba(22,101,52,.04);  }

    .doc > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .lh { padding: 28px 36px 22px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent); }
    .lh-left { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
    .logo-box { width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .logo-box svg { display: block; }
    .co-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -.2px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .co-tag  { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }
    .co-addr { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7; }

    .lh-right { text-align: right; }
    .doc-type { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .po-ref-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto; gap: 2px 16px; text-align: right; }
    .pr-label { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); }
    .pr-val   { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .details-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .ds-cell  { padding: 10px 16px; border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .ds-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .ds-label { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .ds-val   { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 7px; border: 1px solid currentColor; }
    .badge-unpaid { color: var(--red);    background: var(--red-bg); }
    .badge-paid   { color: var(--green);  background: var(--green-bg); }
    .badge-status { color: var(--accent); background: #e8f0fe; }

    .parties { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .party { padding: 16px 20px; }
    .party:first-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .party-label  { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .party-name   { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .party-detail { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.75; }
    .party-detail span { color: var(--ink-light); font-size: 10.5px; }

    .body { padding: 0 36px 28px; }
    .sec-head { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); padding: 14px 0 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }

    .tbl-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    thead tr { background: var(--accent); }
    thead th { padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
    thead th:last-child { border-right: none; }
    thead th.r, td.r { text-align: right; }
    thead th.c, td.c { text-align: center; }
    tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--stripe); }
    td { padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--ink); vertical-align: top; }
    td.seq { color: var(--ink-light); font-size: 11px; width: 36px; }
    .item-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 12.5px; }
    .item-sub  { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-mid); margin-top: 2px; }
    tfoot tr { background: var(--stripe); border-top: 2px solid var(--rule-dark); }
    tfoot td { font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; padding: 9px 12px; }

    .lower { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px; gap: 24px; padding-top: 20px; }
    .amount-words { align-self: start; }
    .aw-label { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .aw-text  { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-mid); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.5; border-left: 3px solid var(--rule-dark); padding-left: 10px; }

    .totals { border: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .tot-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 8px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .tot-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .tot-label { color: var(--ink-mid); }
    .tot-row.grand-total { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; }
    .tot-row.grand-total .tot-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
    .tot-row.balance  .tot-label { font-weight: 700; color: var(--red); }
    .tot-row.balance  .tot-val   { font-weight: 800; color: var(--red); font-size: 13px; }
    .tot-row.amt-paid .tot-val   { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }

    .terms-box   { margin-top: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--stripe); }
    .terms-label { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .terms-text  { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7; }

    .sig-section { margin-top: 32px; }
    .sig-title   { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 14px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .sig-row     { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .sig-box     { border: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .sig-box-header { background: var(--stripe); padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .sig-box-body   { padding: 12px; height: 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; }
    .sig-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
    .sig-role { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-mid); margin-top: 2px; }
    .sig-date { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-dark); font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-light); letter-spacing: .3px; }

    .doc-footer { margin-top: 0; padding: 12px 36px; border-top: 2px solid var(--rule); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-light); background: var(--stripe); }
    .doc-footer strong { color: var(--ink-mid); }

    @media print {
      body { background: white; padding: 0; }
      .toolbar { display: none; }
      .doc { border: none; max-width: 100%; box-shadow: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="toolbar">
    <span class="toolbar-note">Purchase Order Document &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{orgName}} ERP</span>
    <button class="btn" onclick="window.print()">
      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9"/>
        <path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/>
        <rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8"/>
      </svg>
      Print / Save PDF
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="doc">

    {{#if isUnpaid}}<div class="watermark watermark-unpaid">UNPAID</div>{{/if}}
    {{#unless isUnpaid}}{{#if isPaid}}<div class="watermark watermark-paid">PAID</div>{{/if}}{{/unless}}

    <!-- Letterhead -->
    <div class="lh">
      <div class="lh-left">
        <div class="logo-box">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
            <text x="14" y="21" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="white">O</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="co-name">{{orgName}}</div>
          <div class="co-tag">{{orgCountry}}</div>
          <div class="co-addr">
            {{#if orgEmail}}{{orgEmail}}<br>{{/if}}
            {{#if orgPhone}}Tel: {{orgPhone}}{{/if}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lh-right">
        <div class="doc-type">Purchase Order</div>
        <div class="po-ref-grid">
          <div class="pr-label">PO Number</div>
          <div class="pr-val">{{poNumber}}</div>
          <div class="pr-label">Issue Date</div>
          <div class="pr-val">{{createdAt}}</div>
          {{#if expectedAt}}
          <div class="pr-label">Expected Date</div>
          <div class="pr-val">{{expectedAt}}</div>
          {{/if}}
          {{#if receivedAt}}
          <div class="pr-label">Received Date</div>
          <div class="pr-val">{{receivedAt}}</div>
          {{/if}}
          <div class="pr-label">Payment Status</div>
          <div class="pr-val">
            {{#if isUnpaid}}<span class="badge badge-unpaid">Unpaid</span>
            {{else}}{{#if isPaid}}<span class="badge badge-paid">Paid</span>
            {{else}}<span class="badge badge-status">{{paymentStatus}}</span>{{/if}}{{/if}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Details strip -->
    <div class="details-strip">
      <div class="ds-cell">
        <div class="ds-label">Supplier Tax ID</div>
        <div class="ds-val">{{supplierTaxId}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-cell">
        <div class="ds-label">Currency</div>
        <div class="ds-val">{{currencyCode}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-cell">
        <div class="ds-label">Payment Terms</div>
        <div class="ds-val">Due on Receipt</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-cell">
        <div class="ds-label">Order Status</div>
        <div class="ds-val"><span class="badge badge-status">{{status}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-cell">
        <div class="ds-label">Total Items</div>
        <div class="ds-val">{{itemCount}} item{{#if multipleItems}}s{{/if}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Parties -->
    <div class="parties">
      <div class="party">
        <div class="party-label">Vendor / Supplier</div>
        <div class="party-name">{{supplierName}}</div>
        <div class="party-detail">
          Contact Person: <span>{{supplierContact}}</span><br>
          Email: <span>{{supplierEmail}}</span><br>
          Phone: <span>{{supplierPhone}}</span><br>
          Address: <span>{{supplierAddress}}</span><br>
          Tax ID: <span>{{supplierTaxId}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="party">
        <div class="party-label">Ship To / Deliver To</div>
        <div class="party-name">{{#if deliverTo}}{{deliverTo}}{{else}}{{orgName}}{{/if}}</div>
        <div class="party-detail">
          {{#if deliverAddr}}Address: <span>{{deliverAddr}}</span><br>{{/if}}
          {{#if deliverCity}}City: <span>{{deliverCity}}</span><br>{{/if}}
          Country: <span>{{deliverCountry}}</span><br>
          Organization: <span>{{orgName}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Line items -->
    <div class="body">
      <div class="sec-head">Line Items</div>

      <div class="tbl-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>#</th>
              <th>Item Description</th>
              <th>SKU / Code</th>
              <th class="c">UOM</th>
              <th class="r">Qty Ordered</th>
              <th class="r">Qty Received</th>
              <th class="r">Unit Cost</th>
              <th class="r">Amount</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each items}}
            <tr>
              <td class="seq">{{this.index}}</td>
              <td>
                <div class="item-name">{{this.name}}</div>
                <div class="item-sub">SKU: {{this.sku}}</div>
              </td>
              <td>{{this.sku}}</td>
              <td class="c">{{this.uom}}</td>
              <td class="r">{{this.quantityOrdered}}</td>
              <td class="r">{{this.quantityReceived}}</td>
              <td class="r">{{this.unitCost}}</td>
              <td class="r"><strong>{{this.totalCost}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
          <tfoot>
            <tr>
              <td colspan="7" class="r" style="color:var(--ink-mid);font-size:11px;font-weight:400">
                Total Items: {{itemCount}} &nbsp;·&nbsp; Total Qty: {{totalQty}}
              </td>
              <td class="r">{{totalAmount}}</td>
            </tr>
          </tfoot>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Totals + Amount in words -->
      <div class="lower">
        <div class="amount-words">
          <div class="aw-label">Amount in Words</div>
          <div class="aw-text">{{amountInWords}}</div>

          {{#if notes}}
          <div style="margin-top:20px">
            <div class="aw-label">Notes / Special Instructions</div>
            <div class="aw-text" style="font-style:normal;font-size:11.5px">{{notes}}</div>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="totals">
          <div class="tot-row">
            <span class="tot-label">Subtotal</span>
            <span class="tot-val">{{subtotal}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tot-row grand-total">
            <span class="tot-label">Order Total</span>
            <span class="tot-val">{{totalAmount}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tot-row amt-paid">
            <span class="tot-label">Amount Paid</span>
            <span class="tot-val">{{amountPaid}}</span>
          </div>
          {{#if hasBalance}}
          <div class="tot-row balance">
            <span class="tot-label">Balance Due</span>
            <span class="tot-val">{{balanceDue}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Terms -->
      <div class="terms-box">
        <div class="terms-label">Terms &amp; Conditions</div>
        <div class="terms-text">
          1. This Purchase Order constitutes a binding contract upon acceptance by the supplier.<br>
          2. Delivery must be made to the specified location. Partial deliveries require prior written approval.<br>
          3. Invoices must quote the PO Number <strong>{{poNumber}}</strong> to be processed for payment.<br>
          4. {{orgName}} reserves the right to reject goods not conforming to specifications.<br>
          5. Payment will be made within the agreed terms from the date of accepted delivery.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Signatures -->
      <div class="sig-section">
        <div class="sig-title">Authorisation &amp; Acknowledgement</div>
        <div class="sig-row">
          <div class="sig-box">
            <div class="sig-box-header">Prepared By</div>
            <div class="sig-box-body">
              <div>
                <div class="sig-name">{{orgName}}</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Procurement — {{orgName}}</div>
                <div class="sig-date">Date: ___________________</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sig-box">
            <div class="sig-box-header">Authorised By</div>
            <div class="sig-box-body">
              <div>
                <div class="sig-name">Management</div>
                <div class="sig-role">{{orgName}} — Org Admin</div>
                <div class="sig-date">Date: ___________________</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sig-box">
            <div class="sig-box-header">Supplier Acknowledgement</div>
            <div class="sig-box-body">
              <div>
                <div class="sig-name">{{supplierName}}</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Authorised Signatory</div>
                <div class="sig-date">Date: ___________________</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /body -->

    <!-- Document footer -->
    <div class="doc-footer">
      <div><strong>{{orgName}}</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{orgCountry}}</div>
      <div>Document Ref: <strong>{{poNumber}}</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Generated: {{generatedAt}}</div>
      <div>Page 1 of 1 &nbsp;·&nbsp; System-generated document</div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /doc -->

</body>
</html>
